.TH SIGMA_DIFFERENCE 1 2000-1月 "sigma_diff.query" "sigma_diff.query"
.SH NAME
sigma_diff.query \- Compare one query genome against a directory of subject genomes: calculate
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIsigma_diff.query(\fBquery\fR as string, 
\fBsbjDIR\fR as string, 
\fBEXPORT\fR as string, 
\fBwindowsSize\fR as integer = 1000);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Compare one query genome against a directory of subject genomes: calculate
 the sliding window \fBdelta*\fR profile of the query against every subject and
 export each profile as a csv file, then compile all of the profiles into one
 merged matrix csv document.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBquery\fB \fR\- the query genome fasta file path. 
.PP
.PP
\fBsbjDIR\fB \fR\- the directory of the subject genome fasta files. 
.PP
.PP
\fBEXPORT\fB \fR\- the csv output directory. 
.PP
.PP
\fBwindowsSize\fB \fR\- the sliding window size in bp, default 1kb. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
true when the compiled matrix has been saved
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
sigma_difference
